# Learn English — core

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, strict TypeScript, Tailwind 4, Prisma 7.
- Learner and admin pages use root-level routes; do not reintroduce `/english` or `/api/english` prefixes.
- Business logic: `src/services/english/`; pure domain rules: `src/lib/english/`.
- PostgreSQL contains only `En*` models. MongoDB stores Auth.js users and sessions.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and relevant `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` guidance before framework changes.
- Run `npm run quality` before finishing.
